    {
      "subId": "7050702",
      "subQuestName": "Mix Zhongli the specified drink",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705070201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705070201": {
            "id": "705070201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070202"
            ]
          },
          "705070202": {
            "id": "705070202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Enjoy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070203"
            ]
          },
          "705070203": {
            "id": "705070203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Mmm, the tea is clear and glows with a pleasing hue. Its richness is complemented by a floral and fruity fragrance. Exquisite.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070204"
            ]
          },
          "705070204": {
            "id": "705070204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, so Zhongli is even super knowledgeable about tea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070205"
            ]
          },
          "705070205": {
            "id": "705070205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon usually just gulps down the tea and says something simple like, \"Yummy yummy in Paimon's tummy.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070206"
            ]
          },
          "705070206": {
            "id": "705070206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Mindfully savoring the tea shows due respect to the person that brewed it for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070207"
            ]
          },
          "705070207": {
            "id": "705070207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Tea of good quality is hard to come by, and those capable of brewing tea according to the occasion and emotions even more so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070210"
            ]
          },
          "705070210": {
            "id": "705070210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon gets it now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070211"
            ]
          },
          "705070211": {
            "id": "705070211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So could you teach Paimon how to savor tea like you do? It seems you smell it first, then drink it, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070212"
            ]
          },
          "705070212": {
            "id": "705070212",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "That's correct.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070213"
            ]
          },
          "705070213": {
            "id": "705070213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Every type of tea is unique. The more you drink, the more you will understand the subtle differences. Smelling the aroma will reveal the quality of the tea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070214"
            ]
          },
          "705070214": {
            "id": "705070214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Lower-grade teas emit a musty and seemingly scorched scent, whereas ones with a delicate yet soothing aroma are usually of a higher quality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070215"
            ]
          },
          "705070215": {
            "id": "705070215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "If you want to be more particular, according to Liyue ancient tradition, you could acquire a \"Vintage Goblet,\" which is used specifically for examining the aroma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070216"
            ]
          },
          "705070216": {
            "id": "705070216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh no, all this time, Paimon's been missing out on her tea...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070217"
            ]
          },
          "705070217": {
            "id": "705070217",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Not to worry. Knowledge is vast, it's never too late to learn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070218"
            ]
          },
          "705070218": {
            "id": "705070218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "As a beginner, you can try this method: first observe the color. Then, smell the fragrance... And finally, take a sip.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705070219"
            ]
          },
          "705070219": {
            "id": "705070219",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zhongli",
            "text": "Remember, you can understand anything as long as you approach it in the proper order."
          }
        }
      }
    },
